From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kirill <sleeply4cat@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:44:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/18] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6225-chuwi-aupad: add remoteprocs,
 connectivity and inputs

Enable ADSP, CDSP and modem with firmware from the device, Wi-Fi and
Bluetooth on the WCN3950 behind its PMU, the microSD slot, and the power and
volume buttons.

The WCN3950 was identified by its SOC ID, 0x40070120. Unlike the board this
wiring matches, QRB4210 RB2, it isn't a WCN3988. L7 is always on: stock uses
it as SD pad bias, and the host driver has no consumer for it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015ya7egg5XM6dMvKwj1kAyq
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-chuwi-aupad.dts      | 283 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 283 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-chuwi-aupad.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-chuwi-aupad.dts
index 3c60ca456..24faa0bf6 100644
